  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/738385">Definition <span data-tag="738385">1.1.1.6</span>.</a>topological categorycategory!topological A <em>topological category</em> is a category which is enriched over $\CG $, the category of compactly generated (and weakly Hausdorff) topological spaces. The category of topological categories will be denoted by $\tCat $.CG@$\CG $Cattop@$\tCat $ </p>
